.el .ds Aq '
.TH logout 1  "logout " 
.SH NAME
logout \- Log out: delete the stored credential for a registry
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlogout\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-\-revoke\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Log out: delete the stored credential for a registry
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-\-revoke\fR
Also revoke the token server\-side
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg logout \-\-revoke
